### Registrarse (sin token)
POST {{host}}/api/User
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "mario",
  "email": "mario@test.com",
  "password": "1234"
}


### Obtener todos
GET {{host}}/api/User
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Obtener uno
GET {{host}}/api/User/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Actualizar
PUT {{host}}/api/User/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "mario2",
  "email": "mario2@test.com",
  "password": "5678"
}

### Borrar
DELETE {{host}}/api/User/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}